Upstream pin is in UPSTREAM. include/apostrophe.h carries a Zlyme my355
change: open InputPlumber's virtual Xbox 360 pad as an SDL
GameController. The raw fallback uses Xbox indices (A=0, B=1). my355
does not write cpufreq; zlyme-governor owns the clocks. TrimUI maps
are unchanged.
